  "description": "As our flagship 29\" E-MTB, the DECOY SN 29 CORE 4 commands its lineup, offering nothing less than the best in trail performance. Fuelled by the FAZUA Ride 60 ecosystem, powerful assistance meshes seamlessly with the 160/140mm frame, making this the perfect platform for far-from-home adventures on technical terrain. When you're flat-out, the long wheelbase generates stability and rich traction to keep you planted, while the low-slung weight, intuitive geometry, and a diet of carbon fiber keep this bike light on its feet when things get tight. At CORE 4 level, we never hold out on the spec sheet – with class-leading FOX Factory suspension, carbon DT SWISS wheels, and an X0 Transmission drivetrain, this thing means business.Couple that with an Ultra-Modulus frame and a stacked feature list, and you'll find a package ready to reign over your local trail network and beyond.",
